    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Ravi runs $2\\frac{1}{3}$ km on Saturday, and $1\\frac{5}{6}$ km on Sunday. How far does he run in total?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$4\\frac{1}{6}$ km",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{5}{6}&=\\frac{7}{3}+\\frac{11}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{14}{6}+\\frac{11}{6}\\\\&=\\frac{25}{6}\\\\&=4\\frac{1}{6}\\end{align*}$$\nRavi runs $4\\frac{1}{6}$ km in total.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
